    "drag": "Move a companion to the target slot, shifting intervening members. Mouse uses the portrait/card/handle; touch uses the handle so ordinary card scrolling remains available. Pointer preview, destination highlight, edge scrolling, 8px intent threshold, cancellation/cleanup. UUID-only existing save route, no extra save button. Arrows remain available for keyboard users.",
    "authority": "Battle/flight/busy restrictions retained; captured roster checked again at drop. Outside/self/cancelled/stale drops do not save. Rejected saves reload the authoritative team; no Pokemon resource changes."
